Record bounded, hash-bound source JUnit4 annotation declarations

Usage: xtask-68bfab0 android-junit4-declarations [OPTIONS] --source-root <SOURCE_ROOT> --selection <SELECTION> --output <OUTPUT>

Options:
      --repository <REPOSITORY>    [default: .]
      --source-root <SOURCE_ROOT>  Directory containing the selected original sources, with
                                   source-id/path layout
      --selection <SELECTION>      Explicit, hash-bound source selection. This is not exhaustive
                                   reference discovery
      --output <OUTPUT>            External evidence file to create. Existing output is never
                                   overwritten
      --check                      Require byte-identical existing evidence; never update it
  -h, --help                       Print help
